# A tab on one of Chromium's own pages opens after a relaunch (PR #325). Its saved back and forward
# list is left out (PageHistory.restores): putting it back made Chromium build the page's WebUI
# inside the page's creation, and Cra 0.1.38 and 0.1.39 crashed at every launch with
# chrome://settings/privacy selected, until the tab's file in PageHistory/ was removed.
budget rss=900 stalls50=40
pace 0.5

cra://open?url=chrome://settings
wait 4
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"location.href='chrome://settings/privacy'","userGesture":true}
wait 2
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"location.href='chrome://settings/clearBrowserData'","userGesture":true}
wait 2
cra://action/goBack
wait 2
cra://debug?back=before
expect-log back before: selected=chrome://settings/privacy back=1

relaunch
wait 3
reject-log tab \S+ opens with \d+ pages? of history
cra://debug?back=relaunched
expect-log back relaunched: selected=chrome://settings/privacy
